                                "sense_id": "8dd56aa9-45ec-33bd-99c4-97673dd70837",
                                "text": "“I left in a French steamer, and she called in every blamed port they have out there, for, as far as I could see, the sole purpose of landing soldiers and custom-house officers.”"
