                                "sense_id": "8dd56aa9-45ec-33bd-99c4-97673dd70837",
                                "text": "\"He's a bad man—a blamed bad man!\" fluttered Danny Griswold.\n\"That's right,\" nodded Lewis Little. \"He really wants to fight with swords, I believe.\""
